  <meta name="description" content="Disabled holiday ?  Disabled travel guide is an online resource for disabled travellers, friends, family, and carers. Reviews for disabled friendly hotels, locations, attractions and music venues provide information for anyone who likes to travel and dealing with disability because of age, illness or injury, helping them to plan for the perfect day out or disabled friendly holiday." />
